# Parsing Rules
Numeric parsing ALWAYS occurs before evaluation.
755→75.5, 745→74.5, 735→73.5, 725→72.5, 715→71.5.
73= is treated as 73+ (common typing error).
? indicates uncertainty only.
7?→70.0 with uncertainty flag.
'-' by itself means below consideration/not worth scoring.
Never cluster by string similarity.
